<p>Edited the end note a bit. Hopefully the point comes across better.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Explanation&nbsp;of&nbsp;sorts,&nbsp;since&nbsp;I'm&nbsp;not&nbsp;sure&nbsp;it&nbsp;gets&nbsp;across&nbsp;as&nbsp;of&nbsp;now</a></div>
